{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1550.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0b5240907ba913d2902a72898d5ea5a86c28bd266720d33d288cb5062ff5291e","ja":"定期公演の日。劇場を訪れたファンを迎えたのは、\nいつもと少し違うエントランスとアイドルたちで……","zh":"定期公演当天。迎接来到剧场的粉丝们的，\n是与平时略有不同的大厅与偶像们……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1550.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"374a4103c676c2c361fe9437dc9c80ca84a37800ef68961698321f5674a39fbd","ja":"劇場に来てくれてありがとう！\n今日のエントランスは、スペシャル仕様よ♪","zh":"谢谢你来到剧场！\n今天的入口大厅是特别样式哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1550.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9905824f0db153d353441520de8a3a1a15c29c1c1f143d2c69c4ea1a06124d06","ja":"天体公演と『STARDOM ROAD』公演中に撮っていた\nオフショットを展示しています！","zh":"正在展出天体公演以及“STARDOM ROAD”公演期间拍摄的\n花絮照片！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1550.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f2bd5ad31e78b5d5e41af81fe7ccc0aabc78c3043d25671966c6a080700b7262","ja":"私達が展示の説明もするから、\nじっくり楽しんでいってちょうだい♪","zh":"我们也会进行展品解说，\n请好好享受吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1550.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e27db4f61185333dbed14ee56806236221f33f5758af6e402db36b8e8ed48c2d","ja":"ここだけのとっておき裏話も、\nたくさん教えちゃいますからね♪","zh":"这里独家的独家幕后爆料，\n也会告诉你很多的哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1550.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"6b35c6ed33d4405729805780452f6bc63388bfd5c396c1a4518ccc66ba80a8d4","ja":"この日のために、ありさ秘蔵のオフショットを\n大放出しちゃいました！　ファン垂涎モノですよ～っ！","zh":"为了这一天，亚利沙把珍藏的花絮照\n一口气全放出来了！粉丝们绝对会垂涎三尺的哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1550.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"311156040b6168e5198a1d52798c0cc395b335294f5d527c43ac5cb839fda005","ja":"写真ボードは、みんなで飾りつけもしたんですよ！","zh":"照片展示板也是大家一起装饰的哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1550.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"ad23ee533bd254530643f874a5145d162111eb86d31d0167f73a9eeab2c068e7","ja":"コメントもいっぱい書いたから、\nそっちも見てね！","zh":"我也写了好多评语，\n那边也要看哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1550.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"a1c3802c5eefb1f2ca1e65f3b557f8b1782d8570cdcbd12aaaf2591fcd2f85d3","ja":"アイドルちゃんによるアイドルちゃん写真展示会っ！\nしっかり目に焼き付けないと、損ですよ～っ！","zh":"偶像们带来的偶像照片展示会！\n不好好烙印在眼里的话，可就亏大了哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1550.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"ec37e0be436dc0ad02f60655272af7ff7257e4538b711fa1ed7d05ee716b19cf","ja":"それでは、みんなで巡る夢のオフショット展……\nスタートです！","zh":"那么，大家一起巡礼的梦幻幕后照展……\n这就开始！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
